(POLICY CONTRACT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Policy Contract governs AIA Pro Achiever Invest, an investment-linked insurance plan.) Tj
T*
(It should be read together with the Product Summary, Fund Summary, and Fund Fact Sheets for) Tj
T*
(each sub-fund selected.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
('Account Value' means the total value of units allocated to the Policy across all sub-funds,) Tj
T*
(valued at the prevailing bid price on the relevant valuation date. 'Sum Assured' means the) Tj
T*
(death benefit sum insured selected at application, excluding Account Value. 'Critical) Tj
T*
(Illness' means one of the illnesses defined in Appendix A of this Contract, diagnosed in) Tj
T*
(accordance with the stated definitions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1 - PREMIUM ALLOCATION) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Premiums received are used first to deduct insurance and policy charges, with the balance) Tj
T*
(allocated to purchase units in the Policy Owner's selected sub-funds at the offer price) Tj
T*
(prevailing on the next valuation date after premium receipt.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2 - DEATH BENEFIT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(On death of the Life Assured while the Policy is in force, AIA pays the higher of \(a\) the) Tj
T*
(Sum Assured plus Account Value, or \(b\) 101% of Account Value, less any partial withdrawals) Tj
T*
(and outstanding charges.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 3 - CRITICAL ILLNESS BENEFIT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(On first diagnosis of a covered Critical Illness, AIA pays the Critical Illness Sum Assured.) Tj
T*
(The Death Benefit Sum Assured is thereafter reduced by the amount paid, and the Policy) Tj
T*
(continues with the reduced Sum Assured and unaffected Account Value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 4 - CHARGES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Policy is subject to a premium charge, cost of insurance charge \(which increases with) Tj
T*
(the Life Assured's age\), fund management charge levied by each sub-fund manager, and a) Tj
T*
(policy administration charge. Full details and current rates are set out in the Fund) Tj
T*
(Summary, which may be amended by AIA with 30 days' prior notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 5 - LAPSE AND INSUFFICIENT ACCOUNT VALUE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the Account Value is insufficient to cover the monthly deduction of charges, and no) Tj
T*
(additional premium or top-up is received within 60 days of notice, the Policy will lapse and) Tj
T*
(all cover will cease with no residual value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 6 - GOVERNING LAW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Policy is governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Singapore.) Tj
ET
